      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm a bit worried about the preservation aspect too, though. When dealing with these older manuscripts, the sheer volume of uncatalogued or misfiled loose papers can get pretty overwhelming. If we don't have a really rigid system, it feels like the collection could just descend into complete chaos. How do these two systems specifically help prevent that kind of organizational breakdown in a high-volume archive?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
