      "content": "I see. What I'm really struggling with is the \"middle ground\" stuff. Every time we try to sort these loose papers, it's like they just end up in these weird, messy piles that don't fit the main categories. It's almost like there's a force of pure disorder fighting back every time we try to impose a system. Is there a way to classify those \"orphaned\" or miscellaneous items within LCC so they don't just become a disorganized mess in the back of the archive?",
